---
title: "Send In Your Sticker Photo | Dreeve"
description: "Stuck a Dreeve sticker somewhere? Send in a photo with the coordinates and your sticker shows up on the map of Dreeve stickers around the globe."
canonical: "https://dreeve.app/sticker-photo"
robots: "noindex, follow"
ogTitle: "Send in your Dreeve sticker photo"
ogDescription: "Send in a photo of your Dreeve sticker with the coordinates and it shows up on the map."
twitterTitle: "Send in your Dreeve sticker photo"
twitterDescription: "Send in a photo of your Dreeve sticker with the coordinates and it shows up on the map."
twitterImage: "https://dreeve.app/assets/og-image.png"
# Soft launch behind the sticker-map feature flag: keep it out of the sitemap.
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{% block content %}

<main>
    <section class="bg-white max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-5 pt-10 pb-14 md:pt-14 md:pb-20">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
            <span class="eyebrow">Sticker photo</span>
            <h1 class="mt-4 text-[1.75rem] sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 leading-[1.1] tracking-tight max-w-4xl mx-auto">
                Send in your sticker <span class="text-strava-orange">photo</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="mt-4 text-base md:text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                Stuck your Dreeve sticker somewhere? Send us a photo with the coordinates of the spot,
                and your sticker shows up on the map of Dreeve stickers around the globe.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-600">
                <li>
                    <span class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Finding the coordinates.</span>
                    In Google Maps, long-press the spot and copy the numbers at the top, for example <code>51.0543, 3.7174</code>.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <span class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Not at home.</span>
                    Please don't use your home location. Published locations are rounded to about 1 km.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <span class="font-semibold text-gray-900">No recognisable faces.</span>
                    Don't send photos where other people's faces can be recognised.
                </li>
            </ul>
            <iframe data-tally-src="https://tally.so/embed/kbNXLZ?alignLeft=1&amp;hideTitle=1&amp;transparentBackground=1&amp;dynamicHeight=1"
                    loading="lazy" width="100%" height="500" frameborder="0" title="Sticker photo form" class="mt-10"></iframe>
        </div>
    </section>
</main>
{% endblock %}

{% block scripts %}
    <script async src="https://tally.so/widgets/embed.js" onload="Tally.loadEmbeds()"></script>
{%- endblock %}
